; Your Jump tile, as a clean starting point - it was a duplicate of Straight pointing at a profile
; resource that no longer exists, so it would not have loaded.
;
; To build the launch tile you described, add nodes under Build:
;   - a CSGPolygon3D or CSGBox3D set to Operation = Union for the take-off wedge;
;   - a CSGBox3D set to Operation = Subtraction to carve a hole under it.
; The C-turn version is the same idea with the Spine curved round and the Exit marker moved to
; where the turn comes out. The launch ramp does not need its own exit: the track is the turn, and
; a car that clears the ramp lands on whatever is there - which is the shortcut.
[sub_resource type="Curve3D" id="Curve_jump"]
